flowchart TD
  TITLE["EXAMPLE MEMORY CARD — Same log file, different raw point counts<br/><br/>Assume maxPoints / visual_max = 3000<br/>Decision: raw_points > 400 ?"]

  C100["CASE A — raw_points = 100<br/><br/>100 > 400 ? NO<br/>Path = SMALL / REAL POINTS<br/><br/>1. Load all 100 real points<br/>2. Call LTTB with max 3000<br/>3. 100 <= 3000 so LTTB keeps all<br/><br/>FINAL chart points = 100<br/>downsampled = false<br/><br/>Meaning: exact real readings drawn"]

  C3000["CASE B — raw_points = 3000<br/><br/>3000 > 400 ? YES<br/>Path = WIDTH BUCKET + LTTB<br/><br/>1. WIDTH BUCKET into about 3000 boxes<br/>   each box = average pressure<br/>2. Get about 3000 averaged points<br/>3. LTTB with max 3000<br/>   already about 3000 so almost no cut<br/><br/>FINAL chart points ≈ 3000<br/>downsampled = true<br/><br/>Meaning: not every original point.<br/>These are bucket averages"]

  C5000["CASE C — raw_points = 5000<br/><br/>5000 > 400 ? YES<br/>Path = WIDTH BUCKET + LTTB<br/><br/>1. WIDTH BUCKET into about 3000 boxes<br/>   5000 points compressed by averaging<br/>2. Result ≈ 3000 averaged points<br/>3. LTTB safety pass with max 3000<br/><br/>FINAL chart points ≈ 3000<br/>downsampled = true<br/><br/>Meaning: 5000 became ~3000 smooth points"]

  C50000["CASE D — raw_points = 50000<br/><br/>50000 > 400 ? YES<br/>Path = WIDTH BUCKET + LTTB<br/><br/>1. WIDTH BUCKET into about 3000 boxes<br/>   many original points fall in each box<br/>   each box keeps only AVG<br/>2. Result ≈ 3000 averaged points<br/>3. LTTB safety pass with max 3000<br/><br/>FINAL chart points ≈ 3000<br/>downsampled = true<br/><br/>Meaning: 50000 became ~3000 smooth points"]

  SUMMARY["REMEMBER IN ONE LINE<br/><br/><= 400 points:<br/>draw real points directly<br/>LTTB usually does nothing<br/><br/>> 400 points:<br/>WIDTH BUCKET first to about 3000<br/>then LTTB as polish/safety<br/><br/>So 3000, 5000, 50000 all use WIDTH BUCKET<br/>because all are above 400"]

  TITLE --> C100 --> C3000 --> C5000 --> C50000 --> SUMMARY
